   ```dockerfile
   FROM node:14.15.4

   WORKDIR /app

   COPY package*.json ./

   RUN npm install

   COPY . .

   CMD ["npx", "cypress", "open"]
   ```

5. Update your Cypress configuration file (`cypress.json`) to enable screenshot capture:

   ```json
   {
     "baseUrl": "http://localhost:8083",
     "experimentalViewport": true,
     "viewportPreserveAspectRatio": "none",
     "video": false,
     "screenshots": {
       "dir": "cypress/screenshots",
       "onLastFailedTest": true
     }
   }
   ```

   This configuration sets the base URL to the Cypress server port (8083), enables experimental viewport options, disables video recording, and configures screenshots to be saved in the `cypress/screenshots` directory only on the last failed test.

